  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective  is to increase the effective and productive use of sustainable infrastructure services by poor rural communities in selected territories of the regions of Coquimbo, Maule, BioBio, Araucania, and Los Lagos (and any other region as may be proposed by the Borrower and agreed to by the Bank).</narrative>
  </description>
